<title>BELGIUM: COBEPA SEES HIGHER 1996 CURRENT PROFIT, DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>COBEPA SEES HIGHER 1996 CURRENT PROFIT, DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Cie Benelux Paribas SA &quot;Cobepa&quot; said on Wednesday it expected a rise in full-year group current earnings and the payment of a higher dividend on 1996 earnings.  </p>
<p>Cobepa had a first-half 1996 current profit of 2.16 billion francs against 1.889 billion in the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
